var e=`# Mastering the preview

The right panel displays the continuously compiled document. A few useful settings:
- ^zoom_in^ / ^zoom_out^: Zoom in or out the preview.
- **Zoom field**: Type a percentage directly.
- **Compile** (^terminal^): Compiles the document (usually not needed thanks to auto-compilation).

Click an element in the preview: the editor cursor moves to the corresponding position in the source code.

Write further down in the document: the preview re-centers on the element you just added.`;export{e as default};